the orbit, as they call it.

00:00:59.451 --> 00:01:00.367
No, no. This is a podcast

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:02.225
We say things like vagaroo.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:04.510
So you're saying that I'm projecting

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:05.343
Big dick history, originated here.

00:01:05.343 --> 00:01:07.370
Big dick history.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:10.263
Yeah, we had Sound
Effects Theater on this.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:12.660
Big hit, we gotta bring that back.

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:14.600
Yeah, we gotta bring Sound
Effects Theater back.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:17.810
I played that one for
my kids and they were

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:21.060
my kids are not fans of my
work, nor should they be,

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.330
but they really liked
Sound Effects Theater.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:24.971
That was kind of sad.
What?

00:01:24.971 --> 00:01:26.921
My kids are not fans of my work.

00:01:26.921 --> 00:01:28.070
No no, I train them not to be.

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:30.290
I've always wanted them to aim higher.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:33.200
The immigrant dream is,
you want your kids to

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.930
be better and do better than you did.

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:37.540
And so my people came to
this country from Ireland

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:39.470
and then each generation tried to push

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:40.940
the next generation further.

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:44.510
So I need my children to
sort of have some level

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:45.900
of disdain for what I do.

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:46.733
That makes sense.

00:01:46.733 --> 00:01:48.280
And then work at a bank.

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:49.113
Oh.

00:01:49.113 --> 00:01:50.100
That's the plan.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.840
I'd like them both to work at banks.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.500
Not at anything bad.

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:55.980
I want them to be at the

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:56.813
Tellers?

00:01:56.813 --> 00:01:59.260
Yeah, tellers, tellers at banks.

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:00.260
I don't want them, if
they get higher than that

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:02.290
then they're sort of responsible
for the rapacious greed

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:03.534
that's destroying our country.

00:02:03.534 --> 00:02:04.367
Oh.

00:02:04.367 --> 00:02:05.200
