you just opened an account.

00:02:06.985 --> 00:02:07.818
Yeah.

00:02:07.818 --> 00:02:08.684
That's nice.

00:02:08.684 --> 00:02:10.317
Yeah, here's you want
the leather checkbook

00:02:10.317 --> 00:02:11.880
