That was 30 years ago.

00:03:23.271 --> 00:03:27.345
The last time I went in
a bank. (Conan laughing)

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:33.230
They never let me back in.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.870
I remember that little kid in shorts.

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.930
I'm Matthew Gourley, see?

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:41.270
You'll hear from me soon, Mr. O'Brien.

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:42.880
I'll punch you in the gullet.

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:44.360
